guide forever/professions/engineering
title Engineering 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Engineering` from Era-baseline data:
# Blizzard Classic Era client tables (recipes, skill thresholds, reagents,
# vendor prices) via wago.tools, pfQuest (vendors, drops, nodes) and a curated
# trainer list checked against npcs.json. Nothing public confirms Forever
# changed profession recipes, so the Era recipe list is the baseline.
#
# Trainers and vendors are smart targets: the engine sends each character to
# the nearest one of its faction. Farming spots are picked per faction.
#
# Recipe choice: cheapest expected cost to 300 (Classic skill-up chances:
# certain while orange, falling from yellow to grey), with gathered materials
# valued at 4x their vendor sell price; see tools/lib/professions/plan.js.
# Material counts are expected values; yellow and green crafts can take more.
#
# Route:
#     1-37  Rough Blasting Powder (about 55)
#    37-45  Crafted Light Shot (about 13)
#    45-60  Handful of Copper Bolts (about 50)
#    60-75  Rough Copper Bomb (about 21)
#    75-80  Rough Copper Bomb (about 12)
#    80-85  Copper Tube (about 6)
#    85-95  Coarse Blasting Powder (about 30)
#    95-115 Copper Modulator (about 32)
#   115-125 Practice Lock (about 16)
#   125-139 Heavy Blasting Powder (about 23)
#   139-150 Whirring Bronze Gizmo (about 18)
#   150-175 Bronze Framework (about 40)
#   175-210 Gyromatic Micro-Adjustor (about 80)
#   210-225 Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs (about 19)
#   225-245 Hi-Impact Mithril Slugs (about 62)
#   245-264 Mithril Gyro-Shot (about 26)
#   264-288 Thorium Widget (about 26)
#   288-300 Thorium Tube (about 13)

step Apprentice Engineering
  tip Engineering runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 62s in all.
  train Engineering Apprentice
  skill Engineering 1
  buy 5956 nearest -- Blacksmith Hammer: a tool, keep it in your bags

step Linen Cloth
  tip Kill the mobs that drop it at the farm spot Polestar picks for your level and faction. The Auction House works too.
  collect 2589 x21 nearest

